The use cases for sidelink positioning were already discussed by 3GPP ecosystem in [2] - [5] and during preparation of the study item description document. The following use cases were explicitly captured in SID objectives [1]: V2X (TR 38.845) Public safety (TR 38.845) Commercial (TS 22.261) IIOT (TS 22.104) In our view, the sidelink positioning framework once it is developed can be applicable to a broader set of use cases. The existing set of use cases is sufficient to trigger 3GPP study for analysis of sidelink positioning framework.

